      propertyPath: description
      value: 'This is the cylinder block, the main structural body of the engine
        that houses the cylinders and supports all major components.

        This
        is the part where the pistons move up and down to generate power from combustion.

        This
        is the foundation that also contains passages for coolant and lubrication
        oil.'
